            "fallback": "PQ / AB = 1/2 ⇒ x / 5 = 1/2 ⇒ x = 5/2 = 2.5"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Check: the small triangle has half the large base and half its matching side.",
          "eq": "3/6 = 2.5/5 = 1/2",
          "math": {
